---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Photo from '../../components/Photo.astro';
import Presence from '../../components/Presence.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Soft Task">
  <section class="company-cover wrap">
    <div class="company-cover-copy">
      <div class="breadcrumb">
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <span>/ Company</span>
      </div>
      <h1>
        The connections
        <br />
        behind progress.
      </h1>
      <p>
        Software. Data. Intelligence. Infrastructure. We bring the disciplines together around the
        work your business needs to do.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href="#our-presence">
        Meet Soft Task <Icon />
      </a>
    </div>
    <figure class="company-cover-photo">
      <Photo
        name="software"
        alt="Illustrative photograph of a software developer working at a screen"
        eager
        sizes="(max-width: 760px) 100vw, 48vw"
      />
      <figcaption>
        Technology is a team effort.<small>Illustrative engineering photography</small>
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="company-cover-note">
      <span>Singapore headquarters</span>
      <span>Serving clients in 33+ countries</span>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="company-manifesto wrap">
    <h2>One requirement can touch an entire business.</h2>
    <div>
      <p>
        A customer-facing application relies on information held elsewhere. A useful AI workflow
        needs dependable data. A growing platform needs an infrastructure plan that can keep pace.
      </p>
      <p>
        Soft Task works across those connections. We help define the requirement, bring the relevant
        disciplines into the scope and prepare a result that the next team can own.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div id="our-presence">
    <Presence compact />
  </div>
  <section class="company-disciplines wrap">
    <div>
      <h2>
        A connected company.
        <br />
        Specialist focus.
      </h2>
      <p>Explore the capabilities and products behind the wider business.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="discipline-branches">
      <a href="/services/">
        <span>Enterprise engineering</span>
        <strong>Software, AI, data and infrastructure</strong>
        <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </a>
      <a href="/products/tubblor/">
        <span>Tubblor</span>
        <strong>Marketing intelligence and digital growth</strong>
        <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </a>
      <a href="/products/regulix-one/">
        <span>Regulix One</span>
        <strong>AML and KYC workflows</strong>
        <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </a>
      <a href="/products/kytheos/">
        <span>Kytheos</span>
        <strong>Cybersecurity, including STRID</strong>
        <Icon name="diagonal" />
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="delivery-invitation">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>From a first question to an operational handover.</p>
      <h2>
        See how the work
        <br />
        comes together.
      </h2>
      <div>
        <a class="button light" href="/company/how-we-work/">
          Our delivery approach <Icon />
        </a>
        <a class="text-link" href="/company/engagement-models/">
          Ways to work together <Icon />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
<section class="section wrap"><h2>Accountability in our work</h2><p>Explore our policies for fair treatment, privacy, business conduct and security, along with direct routes to ask a question or raise a concern.</p><a class="button" href="/governance/">Governance and trust</a></section>
</Layout>
